+# Third-party notices
+
+The root MIT license covers this project's original source. Dependencies, fonts and other assets retain their own licenses; the root license does not replace them.
+
+## Bundled fonts
+
+| Asset | License file |
+| --- | --- |
+| Manrope | [Manrope OFL notice](dashboard/assets/fonts/Manrope-OFL.txt) |
+| Roboto | [Roboto OFL notice](dashboard/assets/fonts/Roboto-OFL.txt) |
+
+Keep these notices when redistributing the fonts. Font licensing conditions, including reserved-name restrictions where applicable, are defined by the included licenses.
+
+## Dependencies and assets
+
+PHP dependencies are identified in backend/composer.lock. Dart/Flutter dependencies are identified in dashboard/pubspec.lock and packages/portfolio_api/pubspec.lock. Consult each dependency's license when redistributing it; Flutter's in-app license registry also provides notices registered by the application and its dependencies.
+
+UI SVG assets live in dashboard/assets/figma/. This file does not certify their provenance: review their source and applicable redistribution terms before a public asset release. Figma design access and library subscriptions do not by themselves establish permission to redistribute every exported asset. Record any required asset notices alongside this file when provenance is confirmed.
+
+Screenshots in documentation represent development examples; do not replace them with private inquiry data or production credentials. Review content/image permissions separately when publishing your own portfolio data. Personal branding does not imply endorsement of forks.
